    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should check with my doc but i'm already scheduled for a checkup in a few weeks... i don't want to wait that long to start actually being healthy lol. i mean, it's just more greens, right? surely a bit of extra spinach isn't going to stop the medicine from working? i feel like more vitamins is always a good thing.",
